I know many people disagree with me here, but I feel rather strongly
on this point.  The biggest advantage to levels is HP regen.  I
believe you hit diminishing returns after lvl 10 in this regard.  Go
to anything below lvl 10, and the HP regen alone will be a bigger
factor than the slightly weaker enemies.  On top of that, if you
actually go all the way to lvl 3, you aren't going to have very many
skill slots, which you probably want, as a wombat.

Draining yourself temporarily for AC isn't a bad idea if you have a
way to quickly get most of the way back up.  Which probably isn't a
problem.

